{"component":"site/servico","html":"<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/images/logo_ab-96.webp\"/><div class=\"ab-public-site ab-static-light min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-white text-slate-900 antialiased selection:bg-blue-100 selection:text-slate-900\"><a href=\"#conteudo\" class=\"sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:top-3 focus:left-3 focus:z-[60] focus:rounded-md focus:bg-white focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-sm focus:font-semibold focus:text-slate-900\">Pular para o conteúdo</a><header class=\"fixed inset-x-0 top-0 z-50 border-b border-white/10 bg-brand-navy/95 text-white backdrop-blur\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><a class=\"group flex items-center gap-3\" aria-label=\"ABrasil Sistemas — início\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"grid size-11 shrink-0 place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-lg\"><img src=\"/images/logo_ab-96.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" class=\"size-full object-cover\"/></span><span class=\"leading-none\"><span class=\"block text-[15px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] text-white\">ABrasil</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-[9px] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] text-slate-500 uppercase\">Sistemas</span></span></a><nav class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 text-sm font-medium text-slate-300 lg:flex\" aria-label=\"Navegação principal\"><button type=\"button\" id=\"radix-_R_19a_\" aria-haspopup=\"menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"dropdown-menu-trigger\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1 transition outline-none hover:text-white data-[state=open]:text-white\">Soluções<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-3.5\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/sistemas\">Sistemas prontos</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/sobre\">Sobre</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a><a class=\"transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/contato\">Contato</a></nav><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-5 lg:flex\"><a class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white\" href=\"/login\">Entrar</a><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 transition hover:bg-slate-200\">Solicitar orçamento</a></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 lg:hidden\"><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-md bg-white px-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900\">Orçamento</a><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Abrir menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"menu-movel\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-md border border-white/15\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main id=\"conteudo\"><section class=\"relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-brand-navy pt-28 pb-16 text-white sm:pt-32 sm:pb-20 lg:pb-24\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 -z-10\"><picture><source type=\"image/avif\" srcSet=\"/images/site/heroes/automacao-640.avif 640w, /images/site/heroes/automacao-1280.avif 1280w, /images/site/heroes/automacao-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\"/><source type=\"image/webp\" srcSet=\"/images/site/heroes/automacao-640.webp 640w, /images/site/heroes/automacao-1280.webp 1280w, /images/site/heroes/automacao-1920.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"100vw\"/><img src=\"/images/site/heroes/automacao-1280.webp\" alt=\"Profissional registrando uma operação no notebook em um depósito com paletes e balança\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"eager\" fetchPriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full object-cover\" style=\"object-position:35% center\"/></picture><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-brand-navy/85 lg:bg-transparent lg:bg-linear-to-r lg:from-brand-navy lg:from-30% lg:via-brand-navy/85 lg:to-brand-navy/50\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-24 bg-linear-to-t from-brand-navy/80 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.05fr]\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-cyan\">Automação de processos empresariais</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 text-4xl leading-[1.1] font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-5xl\">Sua equipe cuida do que importa. O repetitivo acontece sozinho.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8\">Automatizamos as rotinas que hoje dependem de alguém lembrar, copiar e colar: avisos, cobranças, follow-ups, documentos, relatórios e a passagem de informação entre áreas e sistemas.</p><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row\"><a href=\"#orcamento\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition bg-white text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-200\">Solicitar orçamento<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a href=\"#como-funciona\" class=\"inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md px-5 text-sm font-semibold transition border border-white/25 text-white hover:bg-white/10\">Como funciona</a></div></div><div class=\"min-w-0\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ilustração: um pagamento confirmado dispara aviso ao cliente, recibo e lançamento financeiro\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-[#111a2e] shadow-2xl shadow-black/30 p-5 sm:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-400 uppercase\">Fluxo automático</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-md border border-brand-cyan/30 bg-brand-cyan/10 p-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-dot size-4 text-brand-cyan\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1\"></circle></svg><div><p class=\"text-[10px] text-brand-cyan/80 uppercase\">Quando</p><p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-white\">Pagamento confirmado</p></div></div><div class=\"ml-5 h-5 w-px bg-white/20\"></div><div class=\"rounded-md border border-white/10 p-3\"><p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 uppercase\">Então</p><ul class=\"mt-2 grid gap-2\"><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded bg-white/5 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle size-4 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z\"></path></svg>Avisar o cliente pelo WhatsApp</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 text-emerald-300\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded bg-white/5 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text size-4 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg>Gerar o recibo em PDF</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 text-emerald-300\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded bg-white/5 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet size-4 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg>Lançar no financeiro</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 text-emerald-300\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 rounded bg-white/5 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-200\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bell size-4 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M10.268 21a2 2 0 0 0 3.464 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.262 15.326A1 1 0 0 0 4 17h16a1 1 0 0 0 .74-1.673C19.41 13.956 18 12.499 18 8A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 4.499-1.411 5.956-2.738 7.326\"></path></svg>Notificar o responsável</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check size-4 text-emerald-300\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></li></ul></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-[11px] text-slate-500\">Cada execução fica registrada. Ninguém precisa lembrar.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">O ponto de partida</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Sinais de que um processo pode ser automatizado</h2></div><ul class=\"grid gap-x-8 sm:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Alguém copia dados de um sistema para outro todos os dias</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Clientes deixam de receber retorno porque ninguém lembrou</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Cobranças e lembretes são enviados um a um, manualmente</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Relatórios semanais tomam horas para ficar prontos</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Erros de digitação geram retrabalho e prejuízo</li><li class=\"border-t border-slate-200 py-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-700\">Um departamento espera o outro para seguir o processo</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">O que entregamos</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Automação de processos: o que podemos construir.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-slate-200 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Notificações automáticas</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Avisos por e-mail ou WhatsApp disparados por eventos: pedido aprovado, prazo vencendo, status alterado.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Cobrança e follow-up</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Lembretes de pagamento, retorno de orçamentos e acompanhamento de leads no momento certo.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Atendimento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Registro de mensagens recebidas, distribuição para a equipe e acompanhamento do tempo de resposta.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Documentos e relatórios</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Geração de documentos, recibos e relatórios a partir dos dados do sistema, sem montagem manual.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Movimentação de dados</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Informações que fluem entre sistemas, planilhas e departamentos sem redigitação.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">IA aplicada ao processo</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600\">Quando agrega: classificação de mensagens, leitura de documentos e apoio à triagem — sempre conectada ao fluxo e com revisão humana onde é necessária.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Para a empresa</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">O que muda na prática.</h2></div><ul class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Menos trabalho repetitivo e menos erros</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Prazos e retornos avisados pelo sistema, sem depender de memória</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Departamentos integrados pelo mesmo fluxo de informação</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-800\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check mt-1 size-5 shrink-0 text-brand-blue\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Equipe dedicada a atender, vender e decidir</li></ul></div><div class=\"grid content-start gap-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">Exemplos de como a informação passa a circular:</p><figure class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6\"><figcaption class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Captação comercial</figcaption><ol class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-center\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Formulário do site</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">CRM</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Notificação à equipe</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Follow-up programado</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Vendedor</span></li></ol></figure><figure class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6\"><figcaption class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Cobrança</figcaption><ol class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-2 md:flex-row md:flex-wrap md:items-center\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Vencimento</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Lembrete automático</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Confirmação de pagamento</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4 shrink-0 rotate-90 text-brand-blue md:rotate-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-2 md:contents\"><span class=\"rounded-md border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800\">Baixa no financeiro</span></li></ol></figure></div></div></section><section id=\"como-funciona\" class=\"scroll-mt-20 bg-brand-navy py-20 text-white sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 \"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-cyan\">Como funciona</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-white\">Primeiro entendemos o processo. Depois desenvolvemos a solução.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-12\"><ol class=\"grid gap-x-6 gap-y-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-6\"><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">01</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Entendimento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Entendemos o processo, as pessoas envolvidas e o problema a resolver.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">02</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Planejamento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Definimos solução, arquitetura, prioridades e etapas de entrega.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">03</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Desenvolvimento</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Construímos em etapas, com validação a cada entrega.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">04</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Integração</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Conectamos os sistemas e ferramentas que a operação já usa.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">05</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Implantação</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Colocamos em produção, migramos dados e preparamos a equipe.</p></li><li class=\"border-t pt-5 border-white/15\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold tabular-nums text-brand-cyan\">06</span><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-base font-semibold text-white\">Evolução</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400\">Mantemos, acompanhamos e melhoramos continuamente.</p></li></ol></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_0.7fr]\"><div><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Perguntas frequentes</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Dúvidas comuns.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-8\"><div class=\"divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200\"><div data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_cne_\" aria-expanded=\"true\" data-state=\"open\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Automação é o mesmo que um robô de WhatsApp?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform rotate-180\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"open\" id=\"radix-_R_cne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Não. Mensagens automáticas são só uma parte. Automatizar é fazer a informação percorrer o processo sozinha — entre sistemas, pessoas e departamentos — com regras claras e registro do que aconteceu.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Que ferramentas vocês usam?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Workflows, APIs, webhooks, filas e rotinas agendadas, escolhidos conforme o caso. Na nossa própria operação usamos n8n e integração com WhatsApp conectados ao CRM.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">Dá para automatizar sem trocar os sistemas que já uso?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_sne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Na maioria dos casos, sim. Quando o sistema atual oferece API, webhooks ou exportação de dados, a automação se conecta a ele.</div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-slot=\"collapsible-trigger\" class=\"flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 text-left text-base font-semibold text-slate-900\">E se a automação falhar?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-500 transition-transform\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_14ne_\" data-slot=\"collapsible-content\" class=\"pb-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-600 data-[state=closed]:hidden\">Os fluxos registram cada execução e falha, para que a equipe saiba o que aconteceu e nada se perca em silêncio.</div></div></div></div></div><aside><h2 class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-slate-500 uppercase\">Soluções relacionadas</h2><ul class=\"mt-4 divide-y divide-slate-200 border-y border-slate-200\"><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/integracao-de-sistemas-e-apis\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Integrações e APIs</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Sistemas, plataformas e aplicativos trocando dados entre si, sem redigitação e sem planilha no meio.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/desenvolvimento-de-sistemas\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Sistemas sob medida</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Software construído em cima do processo real da empresa, quando uma ferramenta pronta não atende.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"group flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-4\" href=\"/criacao-de-landing-pages\"><span><span class=\"block font-semibold text-slate-900 group-hover:text-brand-blue-hover\">Landing Pages</span><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600\">Páginas focadas em um objetivo — campanha, lançamento ou captação — com contato direto no CRM.</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right mt-1 size-4 shrink-0 text-slate-400\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></aside></div></section><section id=\"orcamento\" class=\"scroll-mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 py-20 sm:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr] lg:gap-x-20\"><div class=\"max-w-3xl \"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-brand-blue\">Orçamento</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 text-3xl leading-tight font-semibold tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-4xl text-slate-900\">Solicite um orçamento: automação de processos.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 text-base leading-7 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8 text-slate-600\">Conte o que precisa ser resolvido. Respondemos com perguntas objetivas e os próximos passos, sem compromisso.</p></div><div class=\"relative rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-8 lg:col-start-2 lg:row-span-2 lg:row-start-1\"><form class=\"grid gap-5\" action=\"/contato\" method=\"post\"><noscript>O envio do formulário precisa de JavaScript. Se preferir, escreva para <!-- -->__AB_EMAIL__<!-- -->.</noscript><div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"grid content-start gap-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"text-sm leadin